WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.800
[Thunder. Rain.]

00:00.800 --> 00:02.700
11:57 PM. One window is still lit.

00:03.000 --> 00:04.300
[A music box and a ticking clock.]

00:04.300 --> 00:05.900
A Glaze Halloween: Night of the Living Deadlines

00:06.300 --> 00:08.900
Every week, they come back.
[Headstones: Essay 2, Quiz 4, Lab report. Zombie hands burst out.]

00:09.050 --> 00:10.400
Closer…

00:10.450 --> 00:11.100
Uhhh?

00:11.250 --> 00:12.000
[Pop!] Need a light?

00:12.200 --> 00:13.350
Glaze tells you how long you’ve got.

00:13.450 --> 00:15.000
Hover a date for the details.
Due in 2 days

00:15.100 --> 00:18.000
What if…? The what-if calculator works out what you’d need.
You’d need about 84% on each of the 2 items left.

00:18.950 --> 00:19.600
A gust closed your tab?

00:19.700 --> 00:21.000
Glaze kept a copy. What you type is backed up on your device only.

00:21.050 --> 00:22.600
Two new Looks for Halloween
Graveyard and Pumpkin Patch · coming in the next version

00:22.800 --> 00:24.000
Tick something off… pumpkins!
With Expressive motion on

00:24.150 --> 00:27.000
…and a whole house of extras.
Glaze for Blackboard Ultra. Free and open source.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.000
Make Blackboard a little less scary. Happy Halloween.
Free and open source · Chrome and Safari on Mac

00:29.000 --> 00:30.000
Boo!
